  "notes": [
    "Starter catalog from public docs. Extend with internal CPQ docs for exact payload details.",
    "Common incorrect names to avoid: onQuoteLoad (use afterQuoteStudioLoad), onChargeChange (use beforeProductUpdate/afterProductUpdate).",
    "Hook signatures are exact. Do not add resolver/reject callback parameters or host payload parameters such as { record, connectedQuote }; beforeSave, beforeSubmit, and beforePreviewCall take no parameters and return optional Boolean values."
  ],
